# Cloudflare Pages & CDN Headers Configuration
# Optimized for maximum Edge Caching, Web Crawler Speed, and Instant Sub-Second Navigation

# 1. Immutable Production JS & CSS Bundles (Hashed filenames)
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  CDN-Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Cloudflare-CDN-Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Timing-Allow-Origin: *

